<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.51 trln	 vs	    1.54 trln</p>
<p> Operating	  187.21		vs	  217.62</p>
<p> Current	     64.53		vs	   87.94</p>
<p> Net		   27.32		vs	   38.98</p>
